OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a cloudy day with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain, occasionally heavy
OL,7,Facross the west. Drier with some
OL,8,Foccasional brightness around Inverness
OL,9,Fand Nairn. Fresh to strong
OL,10,Fsouthwesterly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FOutbreaks of rain becoming
OL,13,Fconfined to the far northwest this
OL,14,Fevening, turning drier elsewhere.
OL,15,FFurther rain across the west overnight
OL,16,Fbut dry in the east. Windy in the far
OL,17,Fnorthwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
