OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FThe west will see rain
OL,6,Fthrough the day, heavy at times. Drier
OL,7,Felsewhere with patchy rain at times
OL,8,Fand the odd brighter spell. Fresh
OL,9,Fstrong southwesterly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FEarly
OL,12,Frain on Sunday soon clearing to leave
OL,13,Fa bright day with the odd shower. Dry
OL,14,Fand bright on Monday and Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
